-- migration 0008). With no organization selected and only app.user_id set,
-- the API role sees the user's own memberships and the organizations they
-- belong to, and nothing else; with an organization selected it sees exactly
-- what tenant_isolation shows (what it saw before 0008); the policies are
-- SELECT-only and the API role's alone. Role switching checks policies and
-- privileges; the real API login and the HTTP route are tested in
-- internal/tenant and internal/api.
